IMPORT prelude

§ `Fact schema (verbatim from inputs/schema.md)`

DECLARE Ground IS ONE OF Sickness, `Accidental injury`, Neither

DECLARE Cause IS ONE OF
  Skydiving, `Military service`, Firefighting, `Police service`, Other

DECLARE Claim
  HAS `agreement signed`                           IS A BOOLEAN
      `premium paid month`                         IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `hospitalization month`                      IS A NUMBER
      `hospitalization ground`                     IS A Ground
      `age at hospitalization`                     IS A NUMBER
      `causes`                                     IS A LIST OF Cause
      `fraud month`                                IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `misrepresentation month`                    IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `wellness visit month`                       IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `wellness visit provider qualified`          IS A BOOLEAN
      `written confirmation month`                 IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `dispute arisen`                             IS A BOOLEAN
      `unable to settle month`                     IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `arbitration commenced month`                IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `valid arbitration award issued`             IS A BOOLEAN
      `written proof of claim month`               IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `recovery sought month`                      IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `policy term months`                         IS A NUMBER
      `confined in us hospital`                    IS A BOOLEAN
      `continuous confinement days`                IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `claim made setting out basis`               IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Supporting helpers (verbatim from inputs/schema.md; do not redefine)`

GIVEN  `event month` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
       `limit month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`no later than` MEANS
  CONSIDER `event month`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST m  THEN m AT MOST `limit month`

GIVEN  cs IS A LIST OF Cause
       c  IS A Cause
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`arose out of` MEANS elem c cs

§ `1. Policy in effect and conditions`

-- 1.3: "No later than the 7th month anniversary ... you will supply us with written
-- confirmation from the medical provider ... of a wellness visit ... with a qualified
-- medical provider occurring no later than the 6th month anniversary."
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `wellness condition satisfied timely` claim IF
        `no later than` (claim's `wellness visit month`) 6
    AND claim's `wellness visit provider qualified`
    AND `no later than` (claim's `written confirmation month`) 7

-- 1.1(3): "is still pending or has been satisfied in a timely fashion". 1.1 assesses
-- the policy's effect "at the time of the hospitalization", so "still pending" is
-- read here as: the 7-month deadline has not yet passed as of the hospitalization.
-- (Judgement call -- see NOTES.md.)
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `wellness visit condition ok` claim IF
        claim's `hospitalization month` AT MOST 7
    OR  `wellness condition satisfied timely` claim

-- 1.1: agreement signed, premium paid, the 1.3 condition (pending/satisfied), and no
-- cancellation (1.2: fraud, misrepresentation, the 1.3 condition failing, or the term
-- having run out).
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `policy in effect` claim IF
        claim's `agreement signed`
    AND isJust (claim's `premium paid month`)
    AND isNothing (claim's `fraud month`)
    AND isNothing (claim's `misrepresentation month`)
    AND `wellness visit condition ok` claim
    AND claim's `hospitalization month` AT MOST claim's `policy term months`

§ `2. Benefits`

-- 2.1: "confined in a hospital as a result of sickness or accidental Injury".
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `sickness or accidental injury` claim IS
    CONSIDER claim's `hospitalization ground`
    WHEN Sickness            THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Accidental injury` THEN TRUE
    WHEN Neither             THEN FALSE

-- 2.1/2.2: confinement in a US hospital, for no more than 365 continuous days.
-- 2.3: a claim must be made setting out the basis for it.
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `benefit conditions met` claim IF
        `sickness or accidental injury` claim
    AND claim's `confined in us hospital`
    AND `no later than` (claim's `continuous confinement days`) 365
    AND claim's `claim made setting out basis`

§ `3. General exclusions`

-- 3.1(1)-(4): sickness or injury arising directly or indirectly out of skydiving,
-- military service, firefighting, or police service.
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `excluded activity present` claim IS
    any (GIVEN c YIELD `arose out of` (claim's `causes`) c) (LIST Skydiving, `Military service`, Firefighting, `Police service`)

-- 3.1(5): age 80 or over at the time of hospitalization.
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `no excluded cause` claim IF
        NOT `excluded activity present` claim
    AND claim's `age at hospitalization` LESS THAN 80

§ `4. General conditions`

§§ `4.2 Arbitration`

-- "arbitration to be commenced within three (3) months from the day such parties
-- are unable to settle". Never commencing (NOTHING) fails via `no later than`'s own
-- NOTHING case, matching "any ... right to make a claim ... shall be extinguished".
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `arbitration commenced within deadline` claim IS
    CONSIDER claim's `unable to settle month`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
    WHEN JUST u  THEN `no later than` (claim's `arbitration commenced month`) (u PLUS 3)

-- "the issuance of a valid arbitration award shall also be a condition precedent
-- to our liability ... [w]here there is a dispute or disagreement".
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `arbitration timely and awarded` claim IF
        `arbitration commenced within deadline` claim
    AND claim's `valid arbitration award issued`

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `arbitration condition ok` claim IF
        NOT claim's `dispute arisen`
    OR  `arbitration timely and awarded` claim

-- "In no case shall You seek to recover on this Policy before the expiration of
-- sixty (60) days after written proof of claim has been submitted". 60 days is
-- rounded to 2 months to match the schema's month-denominated fields (judgement
-- call -- see NOTES.md).
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
      r     IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `proof submitted long enough before` claim r IS
    CONSIDER claim's `written proof of claim month`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST p  THEN r AT LEAST (p PLUS 2)

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `recovery not premature` claim IS
    CONSIDER claim's `recovery sought month`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
    WHEN JUST r  THEN `proof submitted long enough before` claim r

§ `Top-level decision`

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE covered claim IF
        `policy in effect` claim
    AND `benefit conditions met` claim
    AND `no excluded cause` claim
    AND `arbitration condition ok` claim
    AND `recovery not premature` claim
